{"name":"Boyne Highlands","units":"USC","updated":"2026-11-25T20:23:25Z","liftsUpdated":"2026-11-25T20:23:25Z","trailsUpdated":"2026-11-25T20:23:25Z","commentsUpdated":"2026-11-25T20:23:25Z","operations":{"resortStatus":"Closed","openTime":null,"closeTime":null,"nightOpenTime":null,"nightCloseTime":null,"uphillStatus":null,"summerLiftStatus":null},"currentConditions":{"resortwide":{"totalTrailArea":{"acres":435,"hectares":176},"totalTrailLength":null,"areaOpen":{"acres":0,"hectares":0},"lengthOpen":null,"numTrailsTotal":55,"numTrailsOpen":0,"numTrailsGroomed":0,"numTrailsSnowMaking":0,"numLiftsTotal":8,"numLiftsOpen":0,"numLiftsOnHold":0,"numLiftsClosed":8,"numParksTotal":3,"numParksOpen":0,"numPipesTotal":null,"numPipesOpen":null,"numParkFeaturesOpen":0,"numSummerTrailsTotal":null,"numSummerTrailsOpen":null,"numSummerLiftsTotal":null,"numSummerLiftsOpen":null},"resortLocations":{"location":[{"name":"Boyne Highlands","elevation":null,"primarySurface":"","secondarySurface":"","snowOverNight":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snowOverNightLabel":"Snow Overnight","snowSince5am":null,"snowSince5amLabel":"Snow Since 5am","snow12Hours":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snow12HoursLabel":"Snow 12 Hrs.","snow24Hours":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snow24HoursLabel":"Snow 24 Hrs.","snow48Hours":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snow48HoursLabel":"Snow 48 Hrs.","snow72Hours":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snow72HoursLabel":"Snow 72 Hrs.","snow7Days":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snow7DaysLabel":"Snow 7 Days","snowSeasonTotal":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"snowSeasonTotalLabel":"Snow Season Total","base":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"baseLabel":"Base Depth","baseMin":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"baseMinLabel":"Base Depth","baseMax":{"inches":"0","centimeters":"0"},"baseMaxLabel":"Base Depth","tracksetOpen":null,"tracksetOpenLabel":"Trackset Open","skateGroomed":null,"skateGroomedLabel":"Skate Groomed","snowshoeGroomed":null,"snowshoeGroomedLabel":"Snowshoe Groomed","fatTireOpen":null,"fatTireOpenLabel":"Fat Tire Open"},{"name":"Nordic","elevation":null,"primarySurface":"","secondarySurface":"","snowOverNight":null,"snowOverNightLabel":"Snow Overnight","snowSince5am":null,"snowSince5amLabel":"Snow Since 5am","snow12Hours":null,"snow12HoursLabel":"Snow 12 Hrs.","snow24Hours":null,"snow24HoursLabel":"Snow 24 Hrs.","snow48Hours":null,"snow48HoursLabel":"Snow 48 Hrs.","snow72Hours":null,"snow72HoursLabel":"Snow 72 Hrs.","snow7Days":null,"snow7DaysLabel":"Snow 7 Days","snowSeasonTotal":null,"snowSeasonTotalLabel":"Snow Season Total","base":null,"baseLabel":"Base Depth","baseMin":null,"baseMinLabel":"Base Depth","baseMax":null,"baseMaxLabel":"Base Depth","tracksetOpen":null,"tracksetOpenLabel":"Trackset Open","skateGroomed":null,"skateGroomedLabel":"Skate Groomed","snowshoeGroomed":{"miles":null,"kilometers":0},"snowshoeGroomedLabel":"Snowshoe Groomed","fatTireOpen":{"miles":null,"kilometers":0},"fatTireOpenLabel":"Fat Tire Open"}]},"roads":null},"comments":{"comment":[{"name":"Comment","title":"","background":"Primary","text":"<p><b>The Highlands Is Closed for the Season - Ski You Soon!</b><br />The Highlands is a seasonal resort, which means we close for part of the year and reopen when winter returns. Right now, our snowmakers and team members are getting the mountain and lodge ready for the ski season, and we will announce our opening date as soon as we can. If Mother Nature delivers early, so will we! If Mother Nature struggles and, for some reason, we don't have enough snow and need to delay, we will wait until it makes sense and promise to keep you updated!<br /><br /><b>Book your Winter Stay</b><br />Don't wait, and book your winter ski trip now starting Thursday, December 10.<br /><a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/lodging\">Book your winter stay&gt;&gt;</a><br /><br /><b>What's Available for Winter</b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/season-passes\">2026/27 Season Passes:</a> Ski and ride all winter with a 2026/27 season pass with lots of benefits and flexibility.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/lift-tickets\">Lift Tickets:</a> Visiting for a day or two? Lift tickets get you on the chairlifts for the days you visit.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/lift-tickets\">Ticket Packs:</a> Flexible Lift Tickets: Not sure which days you'll visit? Flexible lift tickets are built for changing plans with no black out dates.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/ski-and-snowboard-lessons\">Snowsports School:</a> New to snow or ready to level up? Our instructors help you get there.<br /><br /><b>Winter Events</b><br />See what's planned at the resort this winter and build your trip around it.<br /><a href=\"https://www.highlandsharborsprings.com/events\">Explore winter events &gt;&gt;</a><br /><br />Be the first to know when the lifts spin. The Alerts &amp; Updates sign-up box is on the right side of this page. We'll also post ski and lift opening details on this page, so check back regularly!<br /><br />We can't wait to welcome you back on the slopes.<br />Your Snow Insider<br /></p>\n"},{"name":"Events","title":"","background":"","text":"<p>Happy New Year! <br />After night skiing, we will have a torchlight parade and fireworks to ring in the New Year! Festivities will begin at 9:30 PM.<br /><br />We hope you are enjoying some time off during winter break. Although there was rain in the area last weekend, we have enough of a base that the conditions remain favorable and in great condition. Lake effect snow is coming to the region tomorrow!<br /><br />In case you haven't heard, we have the MOST TERRAIN OPEN in Michigan! We are beyond excited to have nearly 100% of our terrain open, with 40 trails and hundreds of acres ready to explore.<br /><br />Night skiing is back every night through January 4th. On January 2nd Red Bull will be on-hill with a DJ spinning tunes and giving out samples from 4 - 7 PM.<br /><br />Funland Park is now open with 8 features - 4 jumps and 4 rollers. Shred It!<br /><br />Additionally, the newly opened Interconnect lift makes your journey to North Peak faster and more comfortable! The Camelot 6 bubble chairlift, which debuted last season and is the fastest lift in the Midwest, features heated seats, ensuring a warm and cozy ride on the south end!<br /><br />Our Ski School is open daily, with a full-day kids camp, private lessons, and group lessons.<br /><br />Our Adventure Center is also available for extra fun, with zipline, sno-go, and equestrian.<br /><br />Here is what you can expect today:<br /><br />Lift Hours: 9 AM - 9 PM<br /><br />Lifts: ALL lifts are open! This includes Camelot 6 (the fastest lift in Michigan &amp; it is heated!), Heather Express, Challenger, Interconnect (brand new 3-person chairlift), Amy's, North Face, Renate's Express, Magic Carpet<br /><br />Trails: 40 trails and 2 terrain parks are open. Take a look at the trail status below for the full line-up.<br /><br />The Holidays at The Highlands are where traditions begin! Check our full event schedule on our website for everything going on.<br /><br />A little extra bonus - all season passholders and Ikon receive up to 20% off lodging at the resort. If you are not a season passholder and lodge at our resort, you receive up to 20% off lift tickets.<br /><br />Keep an eye on our Mountain Report and social media for updates, or sign-up for our email newsletter. We will see you out on the slopes soon!<br /><br />Your Snow Insider<br /></p>\n"},{"name":"Fax Comments","title":"","background":"","text":""},{"name":"commentAlert","title":"","background":"","text":""},{"name":"trailsAlert","title":"  ","background":"","text":""},{"name":"liftsAlert","title":"","background":"","text":""}]},"facilities":{"areas":{"area":[{"name":"Boyne Highlands","lifts":{"lift":[{"name":"Amy's","id":1,"status":"Closed","statusIcon":"closed","comment":null,"openTime":null,"close